# Leave unset so the app calls the API on whatever origin it's served from
# (localhost:5000, the devtunnel URL, or Vite dev on :5173 via the proxy below).
# A hardcoded absolute URL here breaks the app on every OTHER origin, since
# that origin's fetch calls become cross-origin and hit devtunnels.ms's own
# AAD sign-in gate instead of the API.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
